	measure 'Weighted NutriScore (g)' = ```
			
			VAR TranzactiiValide = 
			    FILTER(
			        'FactTable',
			        NOT(ISBLANK(RELATED('DimProducts'[nutriscore_score])))
			    )
			VAR Numarator = 
			    SUMX(
			        TranzactiiValide,
			        'FactTable'[Weight (g)] * RELATED('DimProducts'[nutriscore_score])
			    )
			VAR Numitor = 
			    SUMX(
			        TranzactiiValide,
			        'FactTable'[Weight (g)]
			    )
			RETURN
			    DIVIDE(Numarator, Numitor)
			```
		lineageTag: d1e842d3-627f-4564-94ad-46e9b3271c51

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"isGeneralNumber":true}

